== ADR-0011: Char selectors use Unicode scalar values; ranges of characters
== and non-ASCII characters are valid choices.
Module CaseCharChoices

Main :
    C := 'b'
    case C
        'a'..'z' PutLn(1)
        'é' PutLn(2)
        otherwise PutLn(3)
    ;
;
